<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong aircargo agents body elects Lau chairman.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong aircargo agents body elects Lau chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Association of Freight Forwarding Agents (HAFFA), which represents more than 160 freight forwarding agents in the territory,said it has elected Anthony Lau as its new chairman.</p>
<p>Lau, chairman of Baltrans (HK) Ltd, was voted in as chairman at HAFFA's annual general meeting on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He replaces Sam Chung, formerly of Fritz Air Freight (HK) Ltd, who resigned earlier this month.</p>
<p>HAFFA's new vice-chairman is Mark Hellman of Hellmann International Forwarders Ltd.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
